PK = primary key; FK = migrated foreign key; ? = nullable
At parent: || = exactly one, o| = zero or one
At child: o< = zero or many
Solid line = migrated FK; dashed = code relationship
Other user-role/source FKs are listed in the table boxes/reference.
A proposal requires work items in application logic.
No separate Role table; users.roles stores multiple roles."];
